{"hw":"πρυτανεῖον","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">πρυτανεῖον</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πρυταν-εῖον</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ion.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πρυταν-ήϊον</span> (also <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">βρυτανεῖον</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Schwyzer</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">183.15</span> </span> (Crete, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">iii B.C.</span>), cf. Sch.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">N.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.1</span> </span>, and <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> v. πρυτανεύω ), <span class=\"lex-gram\">τό</span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">the magistrates' hall, town hall</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.146</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.57</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.197</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ach.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">125</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.15</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19.32</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ἐν πρυτανείῳ δειπνεῖν, σιτεῖσθαι</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pax</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1084</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">36d</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <spa